A big step for 5G networks. 

@SpaceX selected @Qualcomm #Dragonwing to accelerate @Starlink Mobile's nationwide 5G network, advancing 5G today with an opportunity to lay the foundation for AI-native #6G in the years ahead.

Excited to build Starlink Mobile with you & team @michaelnicollsx.

